I'm realizing that my broad regex is too large for what I need. I should aim for a more targeted search. Maybe using Select-String with specific line ranges would be more efficient. I'm also thinking about using "rg" with just line numbers to tighten things up — particularly for the video in Wenz. This way, I can ensure I'm only focusing on the relevant sections.
